    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1EEACFED15ABF95A",
      "text": "歡迎光臨圓模道館！\\n要再聽一次道館測驗的說明嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1EEACEED15ABF7A7",
      "text": "圓模道館的道館測驗是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]滾橄欖[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1EEACDED15ABF5F4",
      "text": "將仿照橄欖形狀製作的球一路滾到終點，\\n就算通過道館測驗了。\\r\\n明年能夠採收到很多橄欖喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "1EEACCED15ABF441",
      "text": "滾橄欖的會場就在\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]圓模鎮的北邊[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\c\\n詳細規則請洽詢\\n在會場的工作人員。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "5BE83F2D0544DB8E",
      "text": "歡迎光臨滾橄欖會場！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "5BE83E2D0544D9DB",
      "text": "道館測驗滾橄欖是\\n用全身撞向巨大的橄欖球\\r\\n去滾動它的體力勝負！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "5BE83D2D0544D828",
      "text": "只要越過重重的障礙物\\n將橄欖球滾入終點的籃子中，\\r\\n就算通過測驗了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "5BE8442D0544E40D",
      "text": "那麼，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要挑戰道館測驗\\n開始滾橄欖嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "5BE8432D0544E25A",
      "text": "我知道了！\\n希望[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能用力滾出個大豐收！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "5BE8422D0544E0A7",
      "text": "等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好後，\\n請告訴我一聲喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "5BE8412D0544DEF4",
      "text": "歡迎！[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要挑戰道館測驗\\n開始滾橄欖嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "5BE8382D0544CFA9",
      "text": "要是能打贏我，\\n我就讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳抄近路！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "5BE8372D0544CDF6",
      "text": "迷你芙這道牆！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能否越過呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "5BE4BA2D0541C3B8",
      "text": "迷你芙們～！\\n讓路給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "5BE4BB2D0541C56B",
      "text": "用坐騎寶可夢去推它，\\n橄欖就會滾得很遠喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_12",
      "hash64": "5BE4BC2D0541C71E",
      "text": "託[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的福，\\n明年肯定也是個豐收年！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_13",
      "hash64": "5BE4BD2D0541C8D1",
      "text": "道館測驗及格了！\\n恭喜[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_14",
      "hash64": "5BE4BE2D0541CA84",
      "text": "請到櫃台報告\\n道館測驗的結果！\\r\\n與道館館主的對戰也要加油喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_15",
      "hash64": "5BE4BF2D0541CC37",
      "text": "要放棄滾橄欖嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_16",
      "hash64": "5BE4C02D0541CDEA",
      "text": "真的要放棄嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
