      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "8B7B0926C1D6EB56",
      "text": "放棄",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_19",
      "hash64": "5BE4B32D0541B7D3",
      "text": "抄近路就是會碰上考驗！\\n就讓我在此攔下[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_21",
      "hash64": "5BEEAB2D0549FEC0",
      "text": "迷你芙們也認同[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的實力，\\n願意移動啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_20",
      "hash64": "5BEEAC2D054A0073",
      "text": "用對戰去阻擾滾橄欖，\\n是希望挑戰者能感受到\\r\\n栽培橄欖的艱辛啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
